    { "id": "note-overview", "type": "note", "position": { "x": -670, "y": 0 },
      "data": { "noteKind": "text", "noteContent": "A ViT keeps one resolution from start to finish. Swin makes it a pyramid: attend inside a stage, then merge neighbouring patches into fewer, wider tokens, and repeat - so late layers see coarse structure and the cost stays linear in pixels. Here merge is the stride-2 Conv2d between the stages: 64 tokens of 48 dims become 16 tokens of 96.\n\nSwin's other half, shifted-window attention, is not here - the cycle shift it needs has no canvas node - so each stage attends over all of its tokens. The input is a random tensor: the wiring and the shapes, not a trained model.\n\nViT 從頭到尾只有一種解析度。Swin 把它做成金字塔：先在一個 stage 內做注意力，再把相鄰的 patch 合併成更少、更寬的 token，然後重複 — 後面的層看到的是粗結構，計算量也能隨像素數線性成長。這裡的 merge 就是兩個 stage 之間那個 stride 2 的 Conv2d：64 個 48 維 token 變成 16 個 96 維。\n\nSwin 的另一半 — shifted-window attention — 沒有畫進來，因為它需要的 cycle shift 在畫布上沒有對應節點，所以每個 stage 都是對全部 token 做注意力。輸入是隨機張量：看的是接線與形狀，不是訓練好的模型。",
                 "noteColor": "#3d3d1a", "boundToNodeId": "start-1", "boundOffset": { "x": -420, "y": 0 }, "noteWidth": 360 } },

    { "id": "note-merge", "type": "note", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 540 },
      "data": { "noteKind": "text", "noteContent": "Patch merging in one node: stride 2 halves the 8x8 grid to 4x4 and doubles the channels, 48 to 96. Fewer tokens, richer ones - which is why stage2_enc runs at d_model 96.\n\n用一個節點做 patch merging：stride 2 把 8x8 的格點縮成 4x4，通道從 48 加倍成 96。token 變少、變厚 — 所以 stage2_enc 的 d_model 是 96。",
                 "noteColor": "#3d3d1a", "boundToNodeId": "merge", "boundOffset": { "x": 0, "y": 280 }, "noteWidth": 300 } },

    { "id": "note-stage1_bf", "type": "note", "position": { "x": 1490, "y": -380 },
      "data": { "noteKind": "text", "noteContent": "Permute 1,2,0 puts the tensor back as (batch, channels, tokens) so Reshape can fold the 64 tokens into an 8x8 grid. Attention wants a sequence, convolution wants the grid; every Permute and Reshape here switches between those two views.\n\nPermute 1,2,0 把張量轉回 (batch, channels, tokens)，Reshape 才能把 64 個 token 折回 8x8 的格點。注意力要的是序列，卷積要的是格點；這裡每一組 Permute 和 Reshape 都只是在這兩種看法之間切換。",
                 "noteColor": "#3d3d1a", "boundToNodeId": "stage1_bf", "boundOffset": { "x": 0, "y": -380 }, "noteWidth": 300 } }
  ],
